   "label": "Ideal (B2)",
   "name": "Gandalf Izzet — Ideal Bracket 2",
   "notes": [
    "The fastest list that stays Bracket 2: 0 Game Changers, no 2-card infinites, and no fetch or shock lands (fast, pain, filter and pathway lands only). About $174 of cards; the pricey ones are Force of Negation, Otawara, Spellseeker, Snapcaster Mage and Swan Song.",
    "Engine: Gandalf triggers twice per spell with Veyran out or Wizard's Staff on him (Staff's equip costs 1 on a Wizard), so one cantrip can deal 3 to each opponent AND copy itself. Tomik makes each Gandalf hit 4. Fiery Inscription, Electrostatic Infantry, Ral, Storm Conduit, Talrand and Grapeshot close games.",
    "Cost reducers (Goblin Electromancer, Baral, Stormcatch Mentor, Ral, Monsoon Mage, Kaza) turn 1-mana cantrips into free spells; Storm-Kiln Artist turns them into Treasures.",
    "Protection for Gandalf is counterspells plus Samut (all his spells get split second) rather than boots, since Wizard's Staff wants the equip slot.",
    "No 2-card infinites. Watch: Archaeomancer/Snapcaster + Frantic Search + two cost reducers can loop for value; fine at B2, don't build toward it.",
    "Bilbo, Retired Burglar stays in every version by request (\"The Goat\"); he took Gitaxian Probe's slot."
   ],
