   "name": "Gandalf Izzet — Ideal Bracket 3 (3 Game Changers)",
   "notes": [
    "Ideal B2 plus 3 Game Changers: Jeska's Will (in for Faithless Looting) for a big burst of mana and cards on the Gandalf turn, Fierce Guardianship (in for Sleight of Hand) as a free counter that keeps Gandalf alive, Underworld Breach (in for Serum Visions) to recast every cheap spell in the graveyard for a Grapeshot finish.",
    "Other GC options if he'd rather: Cyclonic Rift (one-sided reset), Rhystic Study (slower but huge cards), Ancient Tomb or Mana Vault (raw speed).",
    "Breach + Grapeshot is a strong finisher but not a 2-card infinite in this list (no Lion's Eye Diamond or Brain Freeze).",
    "Bilbo stays here too (\"The Goat\")."
